  "verificationBoundary": "All 60 units remain inventoried and source/design connections reviewed; navigation, View and preview inventory checks passed again on the F36 worktree based on reviewed main f18ca0c7 on 2026-08-28. Browser designs, UI fixtures and real hardware evidence remain separate. Prior HAP/HSP, Trace, recording, cold-start and stale-frame results retain their original scope. The canonical real Flash succeeded and its Runtime/postflight/Artifact evidence remains verified after the reviewed F35 Runtime update; HardwareCampaign is off. F35 real App device-access probes now return a successful empty observation correctly, and a new standard read-only Observe succeeded on the original r4 binding with five independent checks passing. The preceding observation failure is retained; four historical unknown records are unchanged. F36 corrects retained-history focus and exact Job routing; 35 focused contract tests and 47 design interactions passed; the final complete gate passed 1839 Swift tests, App/UI-test bundle compilation, SDD, catalog tests and zero drift. Four native XCTest attempts did not execute assertions because macOS authentication/automation initialization is blocked. Manual bilingual App fixture checks passed exact non-first risk routing, latest success focus and retained old unknown rows; the real Runtime inventory was unchanged. Post-merge real App revisit is still required. No full-goal acceptance."
